Z||000000||JetroGT||01-21-2001||08:14 AM||||I am going to atempt the imposible. I want to try to find a fiero that a friend of mine once owned. I know it's a long shot but mabye it'll spark someones memory.<BR>Facts. <P>Broke down near Fon Du Lac Wisconsin in 98 or 99 I can't rember. She traded it for a Geo Prisim. The cam gear went out.<P>Last seen at 99' Dells Run<P>It was a gold 87 base 4cyl with air.<P>It had a Wilde Acura sticker on the trunk lid.<P>It had a Pontiac Fiero window sticker in gold w/horizontal lines through it.<P>Drivers seat was tore up bad. "usual spot"<P>The guy who bought it lived in Fon Du Lac as <BR>well. As far as I know he had a low miles L4 <BR>put into it by Archie. Or the moter was left over parts that Archie had sold him.<P>Last bit of info..The guy that bought it was Bill. I don't know his last name, and if I did I woulden't post it. Privacy and all that. If anyone knows where I can find this car, let me know. I would like to buy it back, or trade for one of my Fieros.<P><BR>87 Blue GT 5spd<BR>86 Black SE auto V6<P>||||reg||4
