Z||000009||Eric_PA||01-24-2001||06:10 PM||||A good way to hit on a girl yes, but when she totals it, like my ex did, then they expect another. Well when you don't give another they move on. This was my girlfriend, not saying others are like that, but she was.<P>Besides that: I have gotten rid of a car back in 97. IT was a 1990 Sunbird. I traded it for my 97 Grand am. When it was traded there where some things wrong with it. Well any way I found it this past summer when in Hazleton PA looking around in a U-Pull it junk yard searching for Fiero parts. The funny thing is that it only had 50 more miles on the odometer. I guess I traded it at the right time.<BR>||||reg||1
